          <span class="px-2 py-1 sm:px-2.5 sm:py-1 pixel-corners-btn bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700/60 shadow-[1px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,0.6)] flex items-center justify-center sm:inline sm:text-left text-center leading-tight sm:whitespace-nowrap">Flask</span>
